{
  "name": "ConcussiveMist",
  "full_name": "Dominator_Control.QUOVapor_Control.ConcussiveMist",
  "short_name": "ConcussiveMist",
  "type": "Toggle",
  "display_name": "Concussive Mist",
  "display_fullname": "Dominator Control QUOVapor Control ConcussiveMist",
  "display_help": "You surround the target with toxic fumes that have concussive properties. If the target is an ally, enemies will be Taunted. Immediately upon entering the fumes, enemies experience a Stun. Remaining in the mist over time can result in additional stuns. You can attach this power to either an enemy or to an ally. Be warned: when Concussive Mist is combined in very close proximity with Laughing Gas (both centered on the same target), the result is in an unstable mixture that will blow enemies out of the area. Recharge: Long",
  "display_short_help": "Toggle (Ally-Affecting), Foe Stun",
